msgctxt "help:hotel.consumption,kind:"
msgid ""
"Consumption takes the articles out of the room (or the warehouse) to the "
"consumption location. Replenishment moves them from the warehouse into the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"Konsomasyon an pran atik yo nan chanm nan (oswa nan depo a) pou mennen yo "
"kote konsomasyon an. Ranplasman an retounen yo soti nan depo a nan chanm "
"nan."

msgctxt "help:hotel.consumption.line,billable:"
msgid "Charge this consumption to the guest."
msgstr "Chaje konsomasyon sa a sou kliyan an."

msgctxt "help:hotel.consumption.line,unit_price:"
msgid "The price charged to the guest when billable."
msgstr "Pri yo chaje kliyan an lè li faktirab."

msgctxt "help:hotel.hotel,consumption_location:"
msgid "Where the stock goes when consumed in a room."
msgstr "Kote stòk la ale lè yo konsome nan yon chanm."

msgctxt "help:hotel.hotel,party:"
msgid "The party representing the hotel (address, contacts)."
msgstr "Pati ki reprezante otèl la (adrès, kontak)."

msgctxt "help:hotel.hotel,warehouse:"
msgid "The warehouse storing the hotel articles and consumables."
msgstr "Depo ki kenbe atik ak founiti otèl la."

msgctxt "help:hotel.rate,end_date:"
msgid "Last day of validity. Empty means no upper bound."
msgstr "Dènye jou validite. Vid vle di pa gen limit anwo."

msgctxt "help:hotel.rate,hour_price:"
msgid "Price per hour. Empty disables hourly pricing."
msgstr "Pri pa èdtan. Vid dezaktive pri pa èdtan."

msgctxt "help:hotel.rate,max_hours:"
msgid ""
"Longest stay still billed per hour; beyond it the nightly price applies."
msgstr ""
"Pi long sejou yo toujou faktire pa èdtan; pi lwen pase sa, pri pa nwit "
"aplike."

msgctxt "help:hotel.rate,min_hours:"
msgid "Minimum number of hours billed for an hourly stay."
msgstr "Minimòm kantite èdtan yo faktire pou yon sejou pa èdtan."

msgctxt "help:hotel.rate,start_date:"
msgid "First day of validity. Empty means no lower bound."
msgstr "Premye jou validite. Vid vle di pa gen limit anba."

msgctxt "help:hotel.rate,weekend_night_price:"
msgid ""
"Price of nights starting on Friday and Saturday. Empty means the night price"
" applies."
msgstr ""
"Pri nwit ki kòmanse vandredi ak samdi. Vid vle di pri nwit nòmal aplike."

msgctxt "help:hotel.room,location:"
msgid ""
"The stock location of the room (minibar, linen, amenities). Created "
"automatically if left empty."
msgstr ""
"Kote stòk chanm nan (minibar, dra, founiti akèy). Kreye otomatikman si ou "
"kite l vid."

msgctxt "help:hotel.room.type,articles:"
msgid "Articles and consumables normally stocked in each room."
msgstr "Atik ak founiti ki nòmalman nan chak chanm."

msgctxt "help:hotel.room.type,hour_product:"
msgid "The service product invoiced for an hour."
msgstr "Pwodui sèvis yo faktire pou yon èdtan."

msgctxt "help:hotel.room.type,night_product:"
msgid "The service product invoiced for a night."
msgstr "Pwodui sèvis yo faktire pou yon nwit."

msgctxt "help:product.template,hotel_article:"
msgid ""
"Check to manage this product as a hotel article or consumable (stocked in "
"the hotel warehouse and rooms)."
msgstr ""
"Make si ou vle jere pwodui sa a kòm atik oswa founiti otèl (nan depo otèl la"
" ak nan chanm yo)."

msgctxt "help:product.template,hotel_billable:"
msgid ""
"Check if its consumption in a room is charged to the guest (e.g. minibar "
"items)."
msgstr ""
"Make si konsomasyon li nan yon chanm chaje sou kliyan an (pa egzanp atik "
"minibar)."

